    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Allocation Groups",
      "source_hash": 12809816310120375334,
      "context_hash": 7976426520961974641,
      "translation": "할당 그룹",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:16.285116Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "XFS divides the filesystem into **Allocation Groups (AGs)**.",
      "source_hash": 6196004047374223831,
      "context_hash": 7061179081659062506,
      "translation": "XFS는 파일시스템을 **할당 그룹**(Allocation Group, AG)으로 나눕니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "XFS": "XFS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:16.285116Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Each AG manages its own inodes, free space, and B-trees independently:",
      "source_hash": 9049329550651148426,
      "context_hash": 7348621085412832698,
      "translation": "각 AG는 자신의 inode, 여유 공간, B-tree를 독립적으로 관리합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "B-tree": "B-tree",
        "inode": "inode"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:16.285116Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "AG size defaults to roughly 1 GiB (power of 2 ≤ filesystem size / 4).",
      "source_hash": 15106487915059551911,
      "context_hash": 859799596125495012,
      "translation": "AG 크기의 기본값은 약 1 GiB(파일시스템 크기 / 4 이하인 2의 거듭제곱)입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:16.285116Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The number of AGs determines the parallelism:",
      "source_hash": 8522544373940354612,
      "context_hash": 13134640720587521641,
      "translation": "AG의 개수가 병렬성을 결정합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:16.285117Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "B-tree structures",
      "source_hash": 11137029991912313656,
      "context_hash": 3066292590971858560,
      "translation": "B-tree 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "B-tree": "B-tree"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:16.285117Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Free space B-trees (bnobt and cntbt)",
      "source_hash": 13163635491915129376,
      "context_hash": 12078090932591340629,
      "translation": "여유 공간 B-tree(bnobt 및 cntbt)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "B-tree": "B-tree"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:16.285117Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Two B-trees track free space, allowing O(log n) allocation:",
      "source_hash": 602929392594485466,
      "context_hash": 1615981325833318227,
      "translation": "두 개의 B-tree가 여유 공간을 추적하므로 O(log n) 할당이 가능합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "B-tree": "B-tree"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:16.285117Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Inode B-tree (inobt) and free inode B-tree (finobt)",
      "source_hash": 5829951885924949949,
      "context_hash": 9304797065855985267,
      "translation": "Inode B-tree(inobt) 및 여유 inode B-tree(finobt)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "B-tree": "B-tree",
        "inode": "inode"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:16.285117Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Reverse mapping B-tree (rmapbt)",
      "source_hash": 15371134848915880141,
      "context_hash": 7666897384647987183,
      "translation": "역매핑 B-tree(rmapbt)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "B-tree": "B-tree",
        "mapping": "매핑"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:16.285117Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Introduced in Linux 4.8.",
      "source_hash": 6975928235280258823,
      "context_hash": 12935637384819269170,
      "translation": "Linux 4.8에서 도입되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:16.285117Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "Every allocated block is back-referenced to its owner:",
      "source_hash": 6043361685430485008,
      "context_hash": 1820054841413849190,
      "translation": "할당된 모든 블록은 자신의 소유자를 역참조합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:16.285117Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "rmapbt enables: online repair (find which inode owns a corrupt block), online scrub, and reflink COW tracking.",
      "source_hash": 106711053802376833,
      "context_hash": 700560382719646760,
      "translation": "rmapbt를 통해 온라인 복구(손상된 블록을 소유한 inode 찾기), 온라인 scrub, reflink COW 추적이 가능합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "inode": "inode"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:16.285117Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Inode format",
      "source_hash": 13247876597649542124,
      "context_hash": 288808733142834812,
      "translation": "Inode 형식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "inode": "inode"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:16.285117Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "XFS inodes are 512 bytes (configurable to 256 or 2048):",
      "source_hash": 9541846663131664129,
      "context_hash": 9942537205653299140,
      "translation": "XFS inode는 512바이트입니다(256 또는 2048로 설정 가능):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "XFS": "XFS",
        "byte": "바이트",
        "inode": "inode"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:04:16.285117Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Extent format",
      "source_hash": 1682011277425878893,
      "context_hash": 3021867210451667694,
      "translation": "익스텐트 형식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016969Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "XFS stores extents in a compact 128-bit format:",
      "source_hash": 2970448017524377657,
      "context_hash": 6128040823188327994,
      "translation": "XFS는 익스텐트를 128비트 크기의 압축된 형식으로 저장합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "XFS": "XFS",
        "bit": "비트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016970Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Up to ~20 extents fit inline in the inode.",
      "source_hash": 16528983283937485824,
      "context_hash": 3057512059118490892,
      "translation": "최대 약 20개의 익스텐트가 inode 안에 인라인으로 들어갑니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "inode": "inode"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016970Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "Beyond that, a B-tree (bmbt) is rooted in the inode.",
      "source_hash": 4563713418723312909,
      "context_hash": 6718781906497611971,
      "translation": "그보다 많으면 inode에 루트를 둔 B-tree(bmbt)를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "B-tree": "B-tree",
        "inode": "inode"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016971Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Delayed allocation",
      "source_hash": 9373241064873672495,
      "context_hash": 14545925323641269705,
      "translation": "지연 할당",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016971Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "XFS uses **delayed allocation** to improve write performance.",
      "source_hash": 16646534686075455418,
      "context_hash": 10965865126024144316,
      "translation": "XFS는 쓰기 성능을 높이기 위해 **지연 할당**(delayed allocation)을 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "XFS": "XFS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016971Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Instead of allocating disk blocks immediately on write, XFS reserves space in memory and delays the actual allocation until writeback:",
      "source_hash": 10589391312969254062,
      "context_hash": 15606884968998523986,
      "translation": "XFS는 쓰기 시점에 디스크 블록을 바로 할당하는 대신, 메모리에서 공간을 예약해 두고 실제 할당을 writeback 시점까지 미룹니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "XFS": "XFS",
        "memory": "메모리",
        "writeback": "writeback"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016972Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Benefits:",
      "source_hash": 16157224011853046347,
      "context_hash": 15057848878392561259,
      "translation": "장점:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Benefits:": "장점"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016972Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Consecutive writes can be merged into large extents",
      "source_hash": 3417498911840962380,
      "context_hash": 16655589276693658247,
      "translation": "연속된 쓰기를 큰 익스텐트로 병합 가능",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016972Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Allocation happens when more context is available (full file size known)",
      "source_hash": 17518155915046638589,
      "context_hash": 5276273384806741286,
      "translation": "더 많은 정보가 확보된 시점(전체 파일 크기를 아는 시점)에 할당 수행",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016973Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Fewer, larger extents → less fragmentation",
      "source_hash": 557011848846833800,
      "context_hash": 5346438345819985197,
      "translation": "더 적고 더 큰 익스텐트 → 단편화 감소",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016973Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "XFS journal (xlog)",
      "source_hash": 12863620186955388098,
      "context_hash": 13110290767112090268,
      "translation": "XFS 저널(xlog)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "XFS": "XFS",
        "journal": "저널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016973Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "XFS uses its own journaling (xlog), separate from JBD2:",
      "source_hash": 1817202742331822882,
      "context_hash": 2747800781818313467,
      "translation": "XFS는 JBD2와 별개인 자체 저널링(xlog)을 사용합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "XFS": "XFS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016973Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Committed Item List (CIL)",
      "source_hash": 9186866561256678249,
      "context_hash": 15503176078231501710,
      "translation": "Committed Item List(CIL)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016973Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The CIL is XFS's equivalent of JBD2's running transaction, but with delayed flushing.",
      "source_hash": 14274364446008866047,
      "context_hash": 17777860411441382066,
      "translation": "CIL은 JBD2의 running 트랜잭션에 해당하는 XFS의 구조이지만, 플러시가 지연된다는 점이 다릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "XFS": "XFS",
        "transaction": "트랜잭션"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:27:07.418867Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Delayed logging (log intent items) was designed and implemented by Dave Chinner:",
      "source_hash": 14064921091402870544,
      "context_hash": 18383496324753379274,
      "translation": "지연 로깅(log intent item)은 Dave Chinner가 설계하고 구현했습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016974Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Online repair (XFS 5.19+)",
      "source_hash": 4729916735675007112,
      "context_hash": 4088457060851460597,
      "translation": "온라인 복구(XFS 5.19+)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "XFS": "XFS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016974Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A unique XFS feature: repair the filesystem while it is mounted:",
      "source_hash": 16398407730664377047,
      "context_hash": 4851294013593779417,
      "translation": "XFS만의 고유한 기능으로, 파일시스템이 마운트된 상태에서 복구할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "XFS": "XFS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016974Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Scrub works by cross-referencing B-trees: the rmapbt knows every allocated block, so the scrubber can verify that every block referenced by the extent B-tree is also in the rmapbt.",
      "source_hash": 14258107185342329141,
      "context_hash": 11872394769652676713,
      "translation": "scrub은 B-tree들을 상호 대조하는 방식으로 동작합니다. rmapbt는 할당된 모든 블록을 알고 있으므로, scrubber는 익스텐트 B-tree가 참조하는 모든 블록이 rmapbt에도 존재하는지 검증할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "B-tree": "B-tree",
        "B-trees": "B-tree"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:50:39.016974Z",
      "issues": []
    },
